{'symbol': 'SPGI', 'date': '2023-03-22 16:15:00', 'title': 'S&P GLOBAL MARKET INTELLIGENCE RANKS THE BEST-PERFORMING COMMUNITY BANKS, CREDIT UNIONS AND US PUBLIC BANKS FOR 2022', 'text': "ANNUAL RANKINGS UTILIZE MARKET INTELLIGENCE'S PROFITABILITY AND GROWTH DATA AND INTRODUCED A NEW CATEGORY HIGHLIGHTING BANKS BY REGION NEW YORK , MARCH 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- S&P GLOBAL MARKET INTELLIGENCE RELEASED ITS ANNUAL RANKINGS FOR 2022'S BEST-PERFORMING COMMUNITY BANKS WITH ASSETS BETWEEN $3 BILLION AND $10 BILLION, COMMUNITY BANKS WITH ASSETS BELOW $3 BILLION, TOP-PERFORMING CREDIT UNIONS AND TOP PERFORMING U.S. PUBLIC BANKS. A NEW CATEGORY WAS INTRODUCED THIS YEAR: TOP PERFORMING COMMUNITY BANKS BY REGION FOR THE NORTHEAST, SOUTH CENTRAL, SOUTHEAST, WEST, AND MIDWEST."}